	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"話題のねこぶそう、第３弾が参ります！古代の巨大生物を模したねこぶそう形態が可能に！",
			"• １～２弾に引き続き、ねこの原型はねこ造形作家の森口修氏が制作。",
			"• ぶそうはイラストレーター・漫画家として活動中の二条忠則氏が担当。",
			"• ジャケットや各ぶそうに搭載された3mmジョイントにより組み合わせは自由自在。第１弾・第２弾との組み合わせも可能。複数組み合わせることでさらに大きなねこぶそうに！",
			"• パーツを簡単に取り外せるセパレーターを同梱。",
			"• 〈中盛り〉はA,B,C,Dの４種。Aは「アメリカンショートヘア」とサブマリンメカのぶそうセット。Bは「ホワイト」とトレインメカのぶそうセット。Cは「白茶」とトリルメカのぶそうセット。Dは「スコティッシュフォールド（グレー）」とプロペラメカのぶそうセット。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The third installment of the popular Nekobusou is here! It is now possible to create a cat-like form that imitates ancient giant creatures!",
			"• Continuing from the first and second editions, the cat prototype was created by cat sculptor Osamu Moriguchi.",
			"• Busou is in charge of Tadanori Nijo, who is active as an illustrator and manga artist.",
			"• 3mm joints installed on the jacket and each busho allow for flexible combinations. Combination with the 1st and 2nd editions is also possible. By combining multiple pieces, it looks like an even bigger cat!",
			"• Includes a separator for easy removal of parts.",
			"• There are 4 types of <medium size>: A, B, C, and D. A is the \"American short hair\" and submarine mecha set. B is \"White\" and Train Mecha Nobuso set. C is \"White Tea\" and Trill Mecha Nobuso set. D is \"Scottish Fold (gray)\" and propeller mechanism set."
		]
	},
